# NOT ignored, deliberately: htxdev.db
# It is the permanent record of every event ever seen, committed on purpose.
# Measured at roughly 30 MB/year at ten sources. See the Architecture page.
# Two rules that keep that cheap: never VACUUM in CI, and set a concurrency
# group on the sync workflow so two runs cannot both commit the binary.
